            "clause": "M.2",
            "note": "The 2012 header lacks several object/type identifiers and aliases listed in 2023, including vpiInterfaceTypespec, the added net/nettype identifiers, vpiNetTypedefAlias, and singular vpiConcurrentAssertion.",
