          "revision_rule": {
            "clause": "M.2",
            "note": "The 2017 header omits the 2023 net object identifiers vpiNettypeDecl, vpiUnionNet through vpiInterconnectArray, and vpiNetTypedefAlias; it also defines vpiConcurrentAssertions directly as 740 rather than via the new singular vpiConcurrentAssertion alias.",
